==Game Jam V==
Game Jam (or as we like to call it, ‘Jame Gam’) is in full swing once more!

We do these internal events twice a year, and they provide us with a fantastic opportunity to come together as a team and pursue passion projects outside the normal roadmap. Game Jams gone by have introduced projects that eventually became Scurrius, the Hairdresser overhaul, Perilous Moons, Wilderness updates, Project Rebalance, and more!

If you want to see what we’re up to this time, take a look at the '''#OSRSGameJam''' hashtag on X. We’re jamming until Monday, May 6th, so there’ll be '''no game update '''next week – although there may still be some downtime.

==Community Updates==
We've got a couple of things to update you on that aren't strictly related to game content today, so take a look before you race off to make those gains!

===Gielinor Games - Season 4===
The return of the ''fantastic'' Gielinor Games is almost upon us! Gielinor Games 4 premieres on Saturday, May 4th at 6pm UTC on SoupRS' [https://www.twitch.tv/Soup Twitch] and [https://www.youtube.com/@SoupRS YouTube] channels. Check out [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZEystoCEYsE the trailer] for a taste of what's in store!

