===A SkillSpectacular Cooking stream...===
To celebrate the release of RuneScape: The Official Cookbook we're delighted to announce that SkillSpecs will be donning his apron to wreak havoc in the kitchen once again.

Join SkillSpecs on Saturday, April 27th at 7pm UTC on his [https://www.twitch.tv/skillspecs Twitch channel] and see what unique takes he'll have on some of Gielinor's finest recipes.

If you haven't already done so, check out the gorgeous hardback book which is available now in your friendly local bookstore and [https://geni.us/runescapecookbook online retailers]!

